title: Proxmox Backup Server: Node Root Filesystem
agents: proxmox_backup_server_api
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the root filesystem usage of a Proxmox Backup Server node
 (this is the system disk, not the backup datastore). Data is collected via the
 special agent {agent_proxmox_backup_server_api} from the {/nodes/<node>/status} REST API endpoint.

 The service goes {WARN}/{CRIT} when usage exceeds the configured percentage
 levels (default 80/90%).

discovery:
 One service {PBS Node Root FS} is created if root filesystem data is available.
